<title>POLAND: Polish Odra garment maker sale seen by end H1 1997.</title>
<headline>Polish Odra garment maker sale seen by end H1 1997.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>State-owned Polish garment maker Panstwowe Zaklady Odziezowe Odra (Odra) will be privatised by the end of the first half of 1997 through the sale of about 49 percent to a passive investor, the firm's director said.</p>
